# 15-mongo-redis — nothing here calls a model: no key at all.
# `npm run check`, `npm test` and `npm run demo` need nothing set (the local SQLite twin).
# `npm run demo:live` and the live test (tests/live/) read a replica set and a Redis server:
MONGODB_URL=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017,127.0.0.1:27018,127.0.0.1:27019/?replicaSet=rs0
REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6379
# optional: the stores' database (default: the URL's, else agboss) and the schema at start
# MONGODB_DATABASE=agboss
# MONGODB_SCHEMA_SETUP=migrate-on-start
